# QA

After **code changes**, follow [.cursor/skills/post-task-qa/SKILL.md](../../.cursor/skills/post-task-qa/SKILL.md) - run `npm run test:qa` and report pass/fail/skip before marking work done.

Before release or new-event launch, follow [docs/qa.md](../../docs/qa.md).

## Quick checks

- Smoke: landing → active survey → valid code → PDF download
- Negative: wrong code, closed survey, GDG ID/email mismatch
- Visual: `npm run test:pdf` then verify name position/color per slug
- Persistence: `survey_response` row + Storage PDF after submit

## Release gate

All items in [qa.md §7 Release regression](../../docs/qa.md#7-release-regression-checklist) must pass.

API errors: [docs/api/generate-cert.md](../../docs/api/generate-cert.md).
